  "title": "Cant Be Touched (TEST GAME)",
  "description": "Demo version of the game",
  "longDescription": "<!--textBlock-->\n<!--title-->\n# Story\n<!--text-->\nHero's eyes opened in complete darkness, and he had no clue about the place he was in. His hands explored the cold surface to find himself lying on a bed in a strange hotel room. He cautiously raised his head, where the hotel room was very dark except for a faint light seeping from under the door.\n\nIt took a moment for Hero's eyes to adjust to the darkness, but as they became more accustomed, he began to discern the simplicity of the furniture and the smooth walls colored in a subdued blue.\n\nAt that moment, Hero noticed a letter placed on the small table next to the bed. He opened it carefully to find words written in beautiful handwriting:\n\n\"Welcome to the Void. You are here to discover your truth and solve the puzzles. Do not hesitate to search behind the curtain, behind the blue color. Beware of the spirits of blue; they will try to stop you. Make your journey a little long.\"\n\nIn a moment of curiosity and concern, Hero decided to embark on this unusual journey, ready to uncover the secrets of the Void and its mysterious truth, and to overcome the spirits of blue that might pose a threat to him.\n",
